Project origin:

This project traces its initial lineage to the abcdocker project published at:

https://github.com/abcdocker/kube-bt-sync

EasyPanel is a renamed and substantially extended continuation focused on an
open-source Kubernetes and operations control panel. Original copyrights,
trademarks, and third-party dependency licenses remain with their respective
owners.

Third-party dependencies:

EasyPanel uses Go and npm dependencies. Those dependencies are not relicensed
by this project and remain governed by their own license terms. Dependency
manifests are maintained in api/go.mod, api/go.sum, web/package.json, and
web/package-lock.json.
